{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-11-22", "prepared_on": "2026-11-22", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-11-22</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Anthropic mathematician claims to have solved prestigious Millennium Prize problem with Claude<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 數學家宣稱借助 Claude 解開千禧年大獎難題</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic mathematician Levent Alpöge claims to have proved the Riemann hypothesis with the help of Claude. If verified, it would be a landmark result for AI in mathematics.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic 數學家 Levent Alpöge 宣稱在 Claude 協助下證明了黎曼猜想。若獲證實，將是 AI 投入數學研究的重大里程碑。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1010051/anthropic-riemann-hypothesis-millennium-prize-problem\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Can Anthropic afford to put safety first?<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 負擔得起把安全放第一嗎？</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The Verge discusses the Anthropic IPO, after the Claude maker went public on the Nasdaq last Thursday, and whether its safety-first stance can survive public markets.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Claude 開發商上週四在那斯達克上市。The Verge 探討這場 IPO，以及「安全優先」的立場在公開市場中能否維持。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/podcast/1038701/anthropic-ipo-ai-safety-openai-nvidia-structure\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> AI Trend Weekly #295: Microsoft launches 7 AI models at once, competing on performance and token cost<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AI趨勢周報第295期：微軟一口氣推出7款AI模型，拚效能也拚Token成本</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">iThome's weekly roundup (Nov 13–19) highlights Microsoft releasing seven AI models in one go, aiming at both performance and lower token cost.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">iThome 週報整理 11/13～11/19 重點新聞，其中微軟一次推出 7 款 AI 模型，同時追求效能與較低的 Token 成本。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180669\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Google follows OpenAI and Anthropic as Gemini starts supporting Mac computer control<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google跟進OpenAI、Anthropic，Gemini開始支援Mac電腦操作</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google announced on Nov 19 that Gemini can now operate Mac apps, files and websites to complete multi-step tasks, joining OpenAI and Anthropic in computer-use agents.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google 於 11/19 宣布 Gemini 新增 Mac 電腦操作功能，可直接操作應用程式、檔案與網站完成多步驟工作，跟進 OpenAI 與 Anthropic 的電腦操作型代理人布局。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180677\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Google rolls out new search homepage with AI chat history and no search button<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google 推出新版搜尋首頁：有 AI 對話紀錄、取消搜尋按鈕</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google is redesigning its search page to make AI tools even easier to reach, adding an AI sidebar with chat history and dropping the search button.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google 改版搜尋頁面，讓使用者更容易進入 AI 工具：新增含對話紀錄的 AI 側邊欄，並拿掉搜尋按鈕。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/11/googles-latest-search-page-redesign-drops-the-search-button-adds-ai-sidebar/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> VS Code 1.147 lets AI agents operate Chrome and Edge, adds delayed task requests<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">VS Code 1.147讓AI代理操作Chrome與Edge，新增延後發送工作請求</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Microsoft's VS Code 1.147 lets agents drive an external Chrome or Edge browser, schedule task requests for a set time, and auto-pick an AI model by task type.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">微軟發布 VS Code 1.147，允許代理操作外部 Chrome 或 Edge、排程在指定時間送出工作請求，並可依任務類型自動選擇 AI 模型。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180670\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> The Outages Are Just Getting Started<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">大當機時代才剛開始</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">AI is forcing companies to patch systems faster as attackers race to exploit newly discovered vulnerabilities, which could mean more internet outages.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">AI 迫使企業更快修補系統，攻擊者也競相利用新發現的漏洞，網際網路大規模當機可能會更頻繁。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/brace-yourself-for-years-of-outage-chaos/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> API keys exposed via Docker Hub images, abused in as little as 7.86 seconds<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">API金鑰隨Docker Hub映像檔對外曝光，研究發現最快7.86秒就遭濫用</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Stony Brook University researchers found automated scanners harvest cloud keys from public container images. In a honeypot test, an AWS key was used 7.86 seconds after publication.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">石溪大學研究發現自動化工具持續掃描公開映像檔並擷取雲端金鑰。蜜罐實驗中，AWS 測試金鑰在映像檔發布後最快 7.86 秒就被拿來呼叫 AWS API。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180635\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Signal restricts mobile screenshots as it confronts 'existential threat' of AI surveillance<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Signal 面對 AI 監控的「生存威脅」，限制行動版截圖</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Signal is limiting users' ability to take screenshots in both its Android and iOS apps.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Signal 在 Android 與 iOS 應用程式中，限制使用者截圖的能力。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/21/signal-restricts-mobile-screenshots-as-it-confronts-existential-threat-of-ai-surveillance/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> The UN fails to agree on rules regulating 'killer robots'<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">聯合國未能就「殺手機器人」規範達成共識</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">UN diplomats meeting in Geneva worked on rules for autonomous weapons, but after a largely fruitless week only agreed to \"start discussing options.\"</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">聯合國外交官在日內瓦討論自主武器規範，一週談判成果有限，最後僅同意「開始討論各種選項」。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1039554/un-regulations-killer-robots\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}